0.029375242,0.035911307,-0.04896725,0.021736735,-0.0007984459,-0.048201334,-0.022502322,0.016835758,-0.0026127412,-0.023674853,-0.0829364,0.0009026064,0.02175892,-0.013523487,0.02877601,-0.03302877,-0.0034638476,-0.0026787252,-0.04601457,-0.04441137,-0.06551159,0.062689155,-0.01484053,0.022952586,-0.039611816,0.0052064257,-0.047773097,-0.009845611,-0.057708662,0.02387566,-0.02224322,0.029781671,-0.010863847,-0.003073683,-0.02690681,0.0246263,-0.011479128,-0.008972567,0.045648035,-0.03991845,-0.08146233,0.008704543,-0.020715006,-0.012801363,0.024096597,-0.0050531533,0.083761804,0.008890146,0.004748972,-0.051984306,0.012137894,0.028093403,-0.010489374,-0.06610989,0.009991092,-0.07349191],"hash":"6b7e7aa5:1815","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-13T15:29:55.931Z\n- **User:** como funciona hj o nosso atach sei que temos uma dll certo? como fazemos attach dela\n- **Outcome:** Mapeei o código atual. Aqui está como as coisas estão **hoje**: ## O que existe **1. `MuProxy2.Hook.dll`** (C++ x86, em `MuProxy2.Hook\\dllmain.cpp`) - Na `DllMain` (DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH) ela hooka a **IAT** de `send`/`recv`/`WSASend`/`WSARecv` em **todos os módulos** carregados no processo (main.exe, Main.dll, etc.) — dllmain.cpp:159-192 - Cada pacote capturado vai pro named pipe `\\\\.\\pipe\\MuProxy2` no formato `PKT SEND/RECV <hex>` (dllmain.cpp:47-71) **2. `byp.dll`** (a outra, externa) — não é injetada pelo MuProxy2. Ela **conecta sozinha** no app via TCP: - porta **44412** = comandos (`ATTACK_START`, `ATTACK_CONFIG`, `SEND_PACKET`, `CMD ...`) — `HookListenerService.cs:38` - porta **44413** = pacotes - é por ela que o autofire/monsters funcionam (`AttackService`, `MonsterService`, `DllCommandService`) ## O problema: o attach sumiu do código O README (linha 15-16) descreve o fluxo original: > \"O jogo inicia suspenso, a DLL é injetada via `CreateRemoteThread(LoadLibraryA)`, e o processo é retomado.\" Mas olha o `btnLaunch_Click` atual (MainForm.cs:643-652): ```csharp if (!CreateProcess(exePath, $\"\\\"{exePath}\\\"\", IntPtr.Zero, IntPtr.Zero, false, 0, IntPtr.Zero, exeDir, ref si, out var pi)) // ← flags = 0, não suspenso ``` - flags `0` → processo **não** inicia suspenso - **não existe** `WriteProcessMemory`, `CreateRemoteThread` nem `LoadLibraryA` em lugar nenhum do projeto C# Ou seja: hoje o botão **Launch Game só dá start no jogo normalmente** — a `MuProxy2.Hook.dll` **não é injet…\n- **Tools:** search_files, list_directory, read_file","vector":[0.033039887,0.029757572,-0.10664066,-0.060016174,0.025778864,-0.093965165,-0.0069347518,-0.005824062,-0.07309816,-0.0477803,-0.050451986,0.0065756827,0.10827766,0.009143561,0.06452724,-0.05148639,-0.018102532,-0.028995512,-0.06950352,-0.026380965,0.024331821,-0.050382916,-0.012336247,-0.048121355,0.06352752,0.036038257,0.024414804,0.047069237,-0.055002578,0.022664346,0.012131632,0.002863273,0.0045109275,-0.05423608,0.033994965,-0.04479476,0.017669577,-0.02293388,-0.017006185,0.022959806,-0.015320058,-0.042459153,-0.021354489,-0.0034440001,0.03625167,0.021027494,0.023039013,0.07392159,0.06301531,-0.05437705,0.024374614,0.016681239,-0.01484429,-0.06488557,0.059656,0.063604034,-0.03438293,0.03958338,0.03800064,-0.0082996115,0.07971907,0.087828174,0.035541262,0.07734166,0.016296444,-0.00890746,-0.042175252,0.014968364,0.02097612,0.031145785,0.031687394,-0.027702264,0.030551316,-0.019059628,-0.008548095,0.012876785,-0.047920313,-0.07882825,-0.029986689,-0.018111348,0.0027038634,0.023953382,0.075023755,-0.04578121,0.019473119,0.00225002,-0.032697603,0.005901101,-0.047515925,0.06869466,0.016336957,-0.04247018,0.006647251,-0.0024898204,-0.05485915,0.012169656,-0.053268183,0.0016012205,-0.037549652,-0.07113809,-0.023344796,0.018755807,0.02550695,0.013348508,0.025691994,0.06166695,0.026784675,0.0071771173,0.007973419,0.00029221753,0.007374687,0.036007173,-0.026940512,-0.05492619,0.037311822,-0.05158316,0.04281353,-0.05187