6167,0.0033570747,0.03153773,-0.03598739,0.060970545,0.06824587,-0.011603873,0.017153217,-0.018156422,-0.042438254,0.011250827,-0.03488018,0.004031767,-0.021476336,0.07994985,0.08170479,-0.015631648,0.026001032,-0.0015467912,0.030488316,0.062549084,0.0003520301,-0.038345568,-0.026417676,-0.056027234],"hash":"c06dfb7f:398","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-13T23:41:42.300Z\n- **User:** to conseguindo ver os packets na tab packets, mas ainda ta dando esse erros nos logs [15:17:27] [PROXY] [PROXY] Conectado ao servidor real 145.239.149.84:44411 para cliente 127.0.0.1:44411 [15:17:27] [PROXY] [PROXY] Relay 44411:C->S: EOF (read=0) [15:17:27] [PROXY] [PROXY] Relay 44411:S->C: Unable to read data from the transport connection: The I/O operation has been aborted because of either a thread exit or an application request.. [15:17:37] [PROXY] [PROXY] Conectado ao servidor real 145.239.…\n- **Outcome:** Build limpo (0 warn, 0 err) nos dois — Debug 15:40:37, Release 15:40:40. E o processo antigo foi encerrado. **Encontrei a causa raiz dos erros que continuavam:** o binário rodando (build 15:11:58) tinha só o fix do `connCts` — o `catch (IOException)` que eu adicionei **ainda não tinha sido compilado** (o .cs foi modificado às 15:30, depois do build). E mesmo com o cancelamento, restava uma race: o `finally`/`using` dispunha os sockets **imediatamente** após o `Cancel()`, sem esperar o segundo relay terminar. O `ReadAsync` pendente falhava com `SocketException` \"aborted\" (WSAEINTR) antes de processar o cancelamento. **O que mudei agora (3 coisas):** 1. **`await Task.WhenAll(t1, t2)` após o `Cancel()`** (TcpLoopbackProxy.cs:215-218) — o fix de verdade: as duas direções do relay terminam de forma limpa *antes* dos sockets serem disposed no `finally`. 2. **`catch (IOException)`** no Relay (linha 312) — safety net para qualquer caso residual. 3. **EOF silencioso** (linhas 237-244) — o log `EOF` agora só aparece quando a direção realmente transportou dados. Conexões keepalive/probe (como as de 44411 a cada 10s, que não enviam nada) fecham sem log. **Para testar:** 1. Abre o MuProxy2: `F:\\blackrockmu\\psdisabled\\MuProxy2\\MuProxy2\\bin\\Debug\\net8.0-windows\\MuProxy2.exe` 2. Abre o jogo e observa o log **Resultado esperado:** as linhas `Relay 44411:C->S: EOF (read=0)` e `Relay 44411:S->C: Unable to read data... aborted` **desaparecem completamente** (a conexão keepalive não transporta da…\n- **Tools:** read_file, edit_file, search_files, run_command","vector":[0.045296557,0.03905613,-0.11817104,-0.057808228,0.0444448,-0.05484363,0.033385545,0.04813313,-0.0031593323,0.00016817237,-0.020897608,0.005893016,0.0679668,-0.055704847,0.038702548,-0.011961587,0.014618357,-0.04361524,-0.07789122,0.0061685424,0.04712029,-0.010077319,-0.039643083,0.03896491,0.08558326,0.06408311,-0.034751907,0.038344417,-0.034115545,-0.036793094,0.042849943,-0.025023226,0.025843848,-0.013709823,-0.037877664,-0.045434024,0.012444118,-0.04448213,-0.043331034,0.04522958,0.043556284,-0.072233744,-0.017738475,-0.01933012,0.017843438,0.0028917198,0.045383148,0.055086013,0.048620924,-0.11965408,0.05151643,0.051094152,-0.012632147,-0.041500784,0.06738335,-0.006973767,-0.022328837,-0.013572253,-0.0114694545,-0.03718374,0.07765947,0.028195731,-0.010728013,0.05611434,0.0017630517,-0.015230092,-0.07058437,0.032775424,-0.007201922,0.013577059,0.054538157,0.013908425,0.02181531,-0.0015953329,0.009091813,0.045261953,-0.03489214,-0.021597596,0.001407156,0.02247825,-0.0022791023,-0.019616313,0.072403535,-0.015935106,0.02344237,-0.0028487572,-0.030858003,-0.03811488,-0.057672895,0.07612695,-0.00013106815,-0.051990937,0.047237314,-0.03822862,-0.042307388,0.03171337,-0.018533286,-0.022058057,-0.030858885,-0.009116728,-0.021816935,-0.023917323,-0.012772968,-0.05168515,0.031192683,0.039065894,0.025216367,0.003960451,0.016042791,0.007240345,-0.029831527,0.056367088,-0.040054295,-0.042842887,