8062114,-0.016083093,-0.04063279,-0.076141894,0.0048287786,0.029818235,0.013197658,-0.01894481,0.015487112,0.0049416595,-0.00062725804,0.019436147,-0.055951327,-0.032822262,0.024160834,0.035931736,0.00010263504,-0.005080458,0.0021022048,0.0009369927,0.029213816,0.018057765,-0.041566264,-0.024215102,0.018771105,-0.046864014,-0.017361606,-0.022050582,0.0016862326,-0.06927531,0.00092030293,-0.011136475,-0.016298322,-0.033319708,-0.06702257,-0.023499835,-0.006469092,-0.060669255,0.040817007,0.026199883,0.028716577,0.012004143,0.00911415,0.045587063,-0.025006901,0.021096682,-0.004523321,0.054434724,-0.013973076,-0.015394483,0.01922001,-0.022561528,-0.039876133,-0.06677321,-0.056023885,-0.0011706697,-0.032740466,0.012140378,-0.03112206,0.026778921,0.04552336,-0.034082208,0.0050489525,0.041853182,0.049536705,0.0081685,-0.054064352,-0.016416147,-0.0004602442,-0.01085614,0.024519714,0.02502258,0.0020513816,0.009245594,0.009674689,-0.029733185,0.002285344,0.06571628,-0.02160586,-0.040902995,-0.048687402,-0.052631326,-0.010829985,0.02933989,-0.01174433,0.04050369,0.003732469,0.0022320275,-0.019343356,-0.036420196,-0.022870153,0.013685731,0.009926893,-0.01625886,0.03762011,-0.018496152,0.0003592214,-0.0062972507,0.022796059,0.026590284,-0.0076075224,0.05351655,0.14470159,-0.016688528,-0.0071478095,-0.057739377,0.012931908,-0.03709923,-0.028457925,-0.027675591,-0.011211086,0.024007251],"hash":"4f7ac1c3:2135","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-14T22:21:30.216Z\n- **User:** no codigo temos muitos comentarios tambem, de uma revisada e veja se tem algo que vale incluir na skill. tambem gostaria que os topicos da skill fossem divididos entre mds enriquecidos. tipo 1- Architecture & attach flow tem um md so para isso e no skill.md a gente tem uma breve descricao e o comaninho para o arquivo saca?\n- **Outcome:** Pronto. Revi os comentários do código, enriqueci a skill com o que valia a pena, e dividi os tópicos em MDs separados. ## O que mudou **Estrutura** — `SKILL.md` virou um índice enxuto (34 linhas): uma tabela com 10 tópicos, cada um com uma linha de descrição + ponteiro para o MD, mais um bloco \"Quick facts\". Cada tópico ganhou seu próprio arquivo em `references/`: ``` references/01-architecture.md 05-object-array.md references/02-channels.md 06-message-protocol.md references/03-crypto.md 07-build-deploy.md references/04-attack-packet.md 08-config.md 09-golden-rules-debug.md 10-references.md ``` **Correções que o código revelou** (a skill antiga estava errada/desatualizada): - **Object array** (`05-object-array.md`): a tabela antiga marcava `0x19C` como \"Level\" e `0x208` como \"Level2\" — na verdade são `BootsSlot`/`WingsSlot`. Troquei pela tabela completa e correta do `GameObject.h`. `LocalPlayerPtr` corrigido de `0x3BC4F04` → `0x7BC4F04`. - **Skill attack** (`04-attack-packet.md` + `03-crypto.md`): a skill dizia \"0xE5, ainda não implementado\". O código mostra que o caminho **implementado e validado é o 0x19 (TARGETED_SKILL)** — bytes intercalados `[idxH][skillH][idxL][skillL]`, target = `entityIndex ^ 0xEFF5`, cifra C3 (SimpleModulus), direção 0..255. Deixei o 0xE5 como nota legacy. - **C3 / SimpleModulus** (`03-crypto.md`): adicionei o layout completo do objeto SM (72 bytes, slots de chave, inverso modular, bloco 8→11, bit-packing MSB-first, checksum), os endereços `NativeEnc…\n- **Tools:** list_directory, read_file, search_files, manage_todos, skill_manage, run_command","vector":[0.033710886,0.05318783,-0.13946798,-0.054626934,0.050909657,-0.029320663,0.069220625,-0.01424343,-0.032928653,-0.063682064,-0.05646424,-0.016749484,0.10807251,-0.011536739,0.032684155,0.013124803,-0.050496727,-0.042734165,-0.064702965,0.074355476,-0.015472208,-0.02609492,-0.015426876,-0.009888611,0.0674903,0.03914349,-0.025177578,0.013798115,-0.03544186,-0.0035448007,0.0042069354,0.01925478,0.021964574,-0.029930498,-0.0035074959,-0.02999862,0.02010019,-0