23,0.15819573,0.061067183,-0.011580666,-0.031610478,0.008586998,0.017871534,0.0077129737,-0.07356091,-0.017943004,0.0043464415],"hash":"eeba5231:1472","model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","archived":true},{"uri":"file:///f%3A/blackrockmu/.novamind/memory/session-log.md","text":"## 2026-11-15T00:14:31.734Z\n- **User:** pronto, renomeei a pasta, agora mude as referencias nas skills e referencias.\n- **Outcome:** As referências da skill estão atualizadas. A única ocorrência restante de `psdisabled` é em `.novamind/memory/knowledge.md` (linha 832), que é apenas o log desta sessão — não é uma referência de caminho, então não precisa de alteração. ## Resumo A pasta foi renomeada de `psdisabled` → `byp`. Atualizei as referências na skill: - **`.novamind/skills/blackrockmu/references/10-references.md`** (linhas 22–33): substituí o prefixo `psdisabled/` → `byp/` nas 12 linhas da tabela \"Key files\" (caminhos de `gg_bypass2/src/...`, `MuProxy2/...` e `docs/attack_packet_re.md`). Verifiquei os demais arquivos da skill e não precisaram de mudança: - **`07-build-deploy.md`** usa caminhos relativos (`cd gg_bypass2`), sem o prefixo antigo. - **`SKILL.md`** e os outros references não continham a string `psdisabled`. A estrutura interna da pasta `byp/` (`gg_bypass2/`, `MuProxy2/`, `docs/`) permaneceu a mesma, então os subcaminhos das referências continuam válidos.\n- **Tools:** list_directory, search_files, edit_file, read_file","vector":[0.04691372,0.051820237,-0.15298283,-0.029732032,0.05086683,-0.055297412,0.03321179,0.00050623616,-0.0149011165,-0.019204907,-0.06060746,0.015822377,0.071177736,-0.013223141,0.022384208,-0.015561226,-0.055044506,-0.057608046,-0.056702055,0.04346205,-0.009484628,-0.02880622,-0.014135317,-0.011638885,0.09802682,0.00725043,0.0052698455,0.00008844363,-0.02495805,-0.010628011,0.031465434,0.015073364,0.025511736,-0.044767678,0.010071122,-0.030734327,0.06404748,-0.037719857,0.022394635,0.004725384,-0.0062202415,-0.03478949,0.021720776,-0.023083141,0.05374470