o, o novo cabeçalho só aponta para onde ele está: - **Skill `blackrockmu`** — fonte de verdade (SKILL.md + `references/01..10`) - **Memórias persistentes** — fluxo de attach, versão ex603 - **Docs** — `byp/docs/` e `OpenMU-master/docs/Packets/` - Regras rápidas (pasta `byp/`, build, idioma) O arquivo volta a ser um log limpo para as próximas sessões. Pronto para começar o trabalho novo — o que é?\n- **Tools:** write_file, read_file","vector":[0.024427695,0.017816225,-0.15692595,-0.072635606,0.04485856,-0.0810315,0.024262683,-0.016297264,-0.06960742,-0.04886298,-0.048301052,-0.033981774,0.07067495,-0.012286619,0.041415863,0.018088948,-0.060966376,-0.059499044,-0.049141496,0.05590963,0.0038184044,-0.00007272362,-0.034042615,-0.010499227,0.06542868,0.01396758,-0.006293203,0.03188525,-0.0028693571,-0.009702908,0.042356722,0.0066500027,-0.017111076,-0.04267728,-0.025910873,-0.07747375,0.052272886,-0.02485176,0.0033758313,0.00889903,0.017077088,-0.04003488,0.023632426,-0.0031841802,0.04572733,0.056852624,0.027333526,-0.02830206,0.053605713,-0.09179044,0.023063008,0.011869859,0.013338549,-0.024072794,0.09393916,0.05517308,-0.028656645,0.015106917,0.031721614,-0.02391525,0.10855671,0.01069244,-0.01854904,0.0814988,-0.005797271,-0.031889446,-0.041572668,0.029934265,-0.04974961,-0.027292803,0.018231617,-0.025684739,0.024247928,0.015116538,-0.025389018,0.0017696113,-0.053008024,-0.020409346,-0.028432816,-0.0056585055,0.009403562,0.014157198,0.11076082,-0.027824564,0.042698026,-0.012132407,-0.030390294,0.023844775,-0.02617066,0.07722982,-0.017266588,-0.025022034,0.028917165,0.002499657,-0.04381379,0.05441628,-0.035139136,0.027830567,-0.032843415,-0.0118825035,-0.043262113,-0.027076997,0.012524026,-0.022387294,0.03437073,0.04990582,0.0025696561,-0.021192495,-0.03467095,0.010651955,-0.024587035,0.055763874,-0.04553564,-0.036228806,0.023518229,-0.054789174,0.03548921,-0.018079573,0.013595038,0.060539164,-0.05476445,-0.06427651,0.01919038,0.028277216,0.055983283,0.034845408,-0.0295